# Project Skin — science-led skincare engineered for Indian skin

> Project Skin is an Indian skincare brand built on the position that skin is the body's
> largest organ, not a cosmetic surface. We formulate for root causes, publish the
> concentration of every active, and educate before we sell. Literacy first, formulations
> second.

Store: https://theprojectskin.com
Ships within India. Prices in INR are published on each product page.

## What makes Project Skin different

- **Skin as biology, not beauty.** We treat the organ, not the outcome. Diagnosis comes before formulation.
- **Concentrations are published.** Every active is named at the dose it works at, with the mechanism stated. We do not use an ingredient at a token level for label appeal.
- **Climate-responsive.** India is not one climate. Formulations are built for monsoon humidity above 80%, North Indian winters below 30% ambient humidity, year-round pollution load, and a UV index that stays high nearly 300 days a year — not for temperate, single-season markets.
- **Barrier-first.** Actives are paired with phospholipids, sphingolipids and ceramides so treating a concern does not cost you your barrier.
- **Gender-neutral and skin-type agnostic.** Built for skin, not for a demographic.

